sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operator
    participant Ct as Lifecycle controller
    participant Inv as Inventory
    participant BMC as BMC
    participant PXE as PXE and image service
    participant Ag as Host agent
    participant Sch as Cluster scheduler
    Op->>Ct: rack arrives, claim these machines
    Ct->>Inv: register serials and topology
    Ct->>BMC: power on, set one-time network boot
    BMC->>PXE: request boot image
    PXE-->>BMC: kernel and initramfs
    BMC->>Ag: host boots into provisioning
    Ag->>Ct: report CPU, memory, disks, NICs
    Ct->>Ct: does it match the expected profile?
    alt matches
        Ct->>PXE: install the production image
        Ag->>Sch: join as schedulable
    else mismatch or burn-in failure
        Ct->>Inv: quarantine for repair
        Ct->>Op: raise a hardware ticket
    end
